targets.outcome_quote:
Replicating the essential ingredients of the experiments run by Werner and Rothermund [
7
], we obtained a reliable evaluative priming effect using the valent/non-valent categorization task. This finding is important as the design used in the present experiment ensured that strategic, non-automatic processes were unable to contribute to the emergence of this effect.

targets.evidence_quote:
We therefore decided to run a new experiment in which the essential ingredients of the experiments run by Werner and Rothermund [
7
] were combined with the typical priming parameters used by Spruyt and colleagues.
